        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Rudd\n- Bands: AC/DC\n- Albums: Dirty Deeds Done Dirt Cheap\n- Songs: Let's Get It Up\n\nFacts:\n- In 1976, AC/DC released its third LP, Dirty Deeds Done Dirt Cheap, in Australia and Europe.\n- The individual who played bass guitar on AC/DC's third LP, Dirty Deeds Done Dirt Cheap, left the band.\n- After that departure, Phil Rudd became the only Australian-born member of AC/DC.\n- \"Let's Get It Up\" is a song by AC/DC.",
